            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ndiye dziwe ririro hai ra kudzengera. Dziwe hiro atu arirema ela Mlungu waritsambula, tsona ni ra samani phakpwe matsoni. Phahi msengerereni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kubalini Mlungu akuhumireni dza viratu mawe garigo hai, kudzenga dzengo ra chiroho. Tsona akuhendeni mkale alavyadzi-sadaka ariotengbwa kulavya sadaka za chiroho zimuhamirazo kpwa uwezo wa Jesu Masihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
